    {
      "entryId": "1ki-2-10",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Buried in the city of David. First principle: the promised throne-Seed's ancestor dies and stays dead — Peter and Paul both press the point: the grave kept David, not so the Christ.",
