    {
      "entryId": "1ki-8-56",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Rest given according to all He promised by Moses. First principle: the word-audit at the temple's dedication — not one word failed; Hebrews makes the same audit the ground of entering rest.",
