    {
      "entryId": "1ki-19-10",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Elijah's jealous complaint under the juniper. First principle: the prophet's census of faithfulness is wrong by seven thousand — despair always undercounts the faithful remnant.",
